      "content": "\"technically feasible\" is exactly what i'm worried about. it's scary how easy it would be for a massive corporation to hide this in plain sight if they wanted to. if they're already using the hardware to capture data through these patterns, how am i even supposed to protect myself? like, if i'm just sitting in my own house, what can i actually do to stop the devices from sending my private conversations back to them? is there any way to block these kinds of frequencies or just unplug everything?",
